  "recipe": {
    "composition": "Oversized uppercase display type pinned to a page edge; near-black and electric-yellow canvases alternate; one hairline rule and mono captions.",
    "components": "Open ruled blocks and bare numerals, never rounded card grids. One image region at most, never under the title.",
    "narrative": "Claim, proof, offer, before/after, numbers, ask.",
    "nativeCoverage": "Cover, chapter, statement, split text with image region, stat row, list, quote, comparison, bar chart and closing as native text, shapes and chart; source entrance animation, Barlow type and image placeholders are not reproduced."
  },
